Portions of the desktop live-tracker are adaptations of the following
GPL-3.0 project:

  AlbionOnline-StatisticsAnalysis (Statistics Analysis Tool / SAT)
  https://github.com/Triky313/AlbionOnline-StatisticsAnalysis
  Source revision: 9f4471b2905f4152938d84721492c6ac86499750
