  including Aaron Schultz (Triky313).

The adapted tracker portions cover the entity lifecycle and correlation model:
local-player identity from Join responses; GUID-to-object-ID indexing; entity
updates from NewCharacter; and party roster join, leave, and disband handling.
They are implemented for this application's Go/Wails architecture and are
marked in the relevant source files. No affiliation, endorsement, or approval
by the SAT authors or Sandbox Interactive is implied.

